config MACH_TANK3
	bool "TANK3 board"
	default n
	help
	  Support for 8849 TANK3 variants

	  OBLUE (the creator of Unihertz / 8849) TANK3 board family shares
	  one build: 8849 TANK 3, TANK 3 PRO, TANK 3s and 8849 SHARK.
	  Only SHARK ships Android 14 out of the box, the others ship
	  Android 13; from Android 14 on SHARK is folded into the TANK3
	  board target, so a single device tree covers all of them.
	  TANK X (6.12 kernel, Android 16 factory) is a different platform
	  and is not covered by this option.
